  "name": "Outlet",
  "description": "Outlet is an anarchic repository framework designed to investigate the limits of unconstrained pull request integration and collaborative state transitions. By maintaining an unconditional merge policy for any external contribution, the project serves as a low-entropy sink for exploring decentralized version control dynamics and automated contribution pipelines.",
